			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add keybinding evaluateWhen and resolve IPC channels\n\nAdd two new IPC channel constants to the Wind service layer for keybinding evaluation and resolution operations. The `keybinding:evaluateWhen` channel enables conditional keybinding evaluation based on context, while `keybinding:resolve` handles keybinding resolution logic.\n\nThese channels extend the keybinding management IPC surface between the Wind frontend service layer and the Mountain backend, supporting advanced keybinding workflows in the editor.",
